{% comment %}
  KRAK & CO. — "OUR STORY" PAGE SECTION (MASTER COPY)
{% endcomment %}

<section class="our-story-section section-spacing">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px; text-align: center;">
    
    <span class="overline" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;">OUR STORY</span>

    <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem); margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem; line-height: 1.2;">
      We believe India deserves a bigger snack shelf.
    </h1>

    <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--color-text-main); text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        India has always been a snacking country.<br>
        Every region has its favourites. Every family has its recipes. Every street, kitchen and corner has a snack worth discovering.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        But we wanted to look at snacking a little differently.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        What if the snacks we love could meet the flavours we crave today? What if regional favourites weren't just something we remembered, but something we could rediscover, share and make part of our everyday lives?
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary);">
        That's where KRAK &amp; CO. comes in.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        We are here to celebrate India's snack culture, give familiar flavours a fresh energy and make every snack break a little more exciting.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-main); text-align: center; margin: 2.5rem 0 2rem;">
        We don't believe snacks need a special occasion.<br>
        <span style="color: var(--color-primary);">We believe the snack is the occasion.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: var(--color-primary);">
        Welcome to our world.<br>
        Welcome to KRAK &amp; CO.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.95rem 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">
        EXPLORE OUR SNACKS &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story Section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
